From 38ef38016cc980f0372d617c82580bcc75aeb38f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Sep 2022 14:24:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 075/841] feat(fwu): introduce plat_fwu_is_enabled()

Before initializing FWU, it could be handy to check at platform level
that all conditions are met. This can be useful after coming back from
low power state, and we do not want to reload binaries from storage
devices. The plat_fwu_is_enabled() function now returns true for all
platforms using FWU.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git c263bdd146bbf2c9e7d3d5f172f314003b24ebc0 feat(fwu): introduce plat_fwu_is_enabled()]
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I80226b2add16b423b529b6bca18607d539dbfa15
---
 bl2/bl2_main.c                   |  4 +++-
 docs/porting-guide.rst           | 12 ++++++++++++
 include/plat/common/platform.h   |  1 +
 plat/arm/common/arm_io_storage.c |  7 ++++++-
 plat/st/common/bl2_io_storage.c  |  5 +++++
 5 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bl2/bl2_main.c b/bl2/bl2_main.c
index 923a554fb..1a1efcfab 100644
--- a/bl2/bl2_main.c
+++ b/bl2/bl2_main.c
@@ -99,7 +99,9 @@ void bl2_main(void)
 	bl2_arch_setup();
 
 #if PSA_FWU_SUPPORT
-	fwu_init();
+	if (plat_fwu_is_enabled()) {
+		fwu_init();
+	}
 #endif /* PSA_FWU_SUPPORT */
 
 	crypto_mod_init();
diff --git a/docs/porting-guide.rst b/docs/porting-guide.rst
index 7c66d1118..26833f656 100644
--- a/docs/porting-guide.rst
+++ b/docs/porting-guide.rst
@@ -1231,6 +1231,18 @@ resets while booting from the active bank, the platform can then switch to boot
 from a different bank. This function then returns the bank that the platform
 should boot its images from.
 
+Function : plat_fwu_is_enabled() [when PSA_FWU_SUPPORT == 1]
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+::
+
+    Argument : void
+    Return   : bool
+
+This function is mandatory when PSA_FWU_SUPPORT is enabled. It checks at
+platform level that all conditions are met to initialize FWU process.
+
+
 Common optional modifications
 -----------------------------
 
diff --git a/include/plat/common/platform.h b/include/plat/common/platform.h
index 621f9910c..befa33bf3 100644
--- a/include/plat/common/platform.h
+++ b/include/plat/common/platform.h
@@ -450,6 +450,7 @@ int plat_fwu_set_metadata_image_source(unsigned int image_id,
 				       uintptr_t *image_spec);
 void plat_fwu_set_images_source(const struct fwu_metadata *metadata);
 uint32_t plat_fwu_get_boot_idx(void);
+bool plat_fwu_is_enabled(void);
 
 /*
  * Optional function to indicate if cache management operations can be
